flowchart TD
    A[Uploaded image] --> B["Input checks<br/>load_image: format, size, EXIF rotation"]
    B --> C["Quality metrics<br/>brightness, contrast, sharpness"]
    C --> D["Adaptive enhancement<br/>gamma, bilateral, CLAHE, unsharp"]
    D --> E["YOLO11 vehicle detector<br/>ONNX"]
    E -->|vehicle found| F["GrabCut box refinement<br/>kept only if IoU at least 0.6"]
    E -->|nothing found| G["Canny + contour ROI fallback"]
    F --> H[Crop up to 3 vehicles]
    G --> H
    H --> I["ConvNeXt V2 classifier<br/>flip TTA, quantized ONNX if accuracy holds"]
    H --> J["Classical features + softmax regression<br/>HOG, LBP, colour, geometry"]
    I --> K["Temperature-scaled probabilities"]
    K --> L["Log-linear fusion<br/>weight chosen on validation"]
    J --> L
    L --> M["Hierarchy roll-up<br/>class, make + model, make"]
    M --> N{"Threshold for each level<br/>chosen on validation"}
    N --> O1[Make, model, year]
    N --> O2["Make, model, years uncertain"]
    N --> O3[Make only]
    N --> O4[Abstain: possibly unknown]
    O1 --> P["Gradio app: boxes, labels, confidence, intermediates, comparison"]
    O2 --> P
    O3 --> P
    O4 --> P
    G -.->|low confidence| Q[No vehicle message]
    Q --> P
